      "description_html": "<div class=\"accordion__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"accordion__body\" id=\"description-main\" data-accordion-body=\"\">\n<div class=\"accordion-content__holder accordion-content__holder--truncate\" data-truncated-holder=\"\">\n<div class=\"accordion-content__inner\">\n<div class=\"accordion-content__entry\" data-truncated-content=\"accordion-content__entry--truncate\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<p>The Baobab Collection snuffer is a beautiful decorative object coated in a silver metallic paint. Its cube-shaped bell will allow you to put out your candles in an elegant fashion.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>USE</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__tab-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<p><span class=\"metafield-multi_line_text_field\">To use a candle snuffer, gently place the snuffer's bell over the candle flame until it extinguishes. This prevents wax splatters and smoke. Lift the snuffer away, and let the candle cool before moving it.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__tab-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-title\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion__wrapper 