      "description_html": "<div class=\"accordion__wrapper\">\n<div data-accordion-body=\"\" id=\"description-main\" class=\"accordion__body\">\n<div data-truncated-holder=\"\" class=\"accordion-content__holder accordion-content__holder--truncate\">\n<div class=\"accordion-content__inner\">\n<div data-truncated-content=\"accordion-content__entry--truncate\" class=\"accordion-content__entry\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<p>Essential and minimalist, this accessory will allow you to keep the wicks of your Baobab Collection candle at an ideal length and avoid smoking.<br></p>\n<p><strong>USE</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__tab-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content active\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion\">\n<div class=\"product__tab-content-accordion-content\">\n<p><span class=\"metafield-multi_line_text_field\">To use your wick trimmer, simply trim the wick to about 1/2 inch above the wax before lighting the candle. This helps the candle burn cleanly and evenly, reducing smoke and extending its life. Dispose of the trimmings and repeat each time before lighting.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-title=\"shipping\" class=\"accordion__wrapper shipping\"><br></div>"
